  "descripcion": "Explore the charm of inland Greece and discover enchanting islands, with approx. 14 cities waiting to be discovered. Picture yourself cruising through postcard-perfect villages, navigating winding roads, and passing iconic landmarks, immersing yourself in the centuries-old tapestry of Greek culture.",
